<h1 class="page-title"><%= t('privacyTitle') %></h1>
<div class="section">
  <p><b>LoveLink — Privacy Policy</b></p>
  <p>LoveLink is for adults 18 and older only.</p>
  <ul>
    <li><b>What we collect:</b> your name, phone, email (optional), age, gender, profile answers, city and location coordinates, photos, likes, matches and messages.</li>
    <li><b>Location:</b> we store your latitude/longitude to sort matches by distance. Other users see only the distance (e.g. “2 km away”), never your exact location.</li>
    <li><b>Photos &amp; messages:</b> stored so matches can see them. Chat images are stored in our database.</li>
    <li><b>Payments:</b> Premium is paid by Telebirr/CBE transfer; you upload a receipt photo which our team reviews. We never see your bank password.</li>
    <li><b>Reports &amp; blocks:</b> reported profiles are reviewed by our team. Banned users cannot sign in.</li>
    <li><b>Deletion:</b> contact support to delete your account and data.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>By using LoveLink you confirm you are 18 or older and agree to be kind and honest. Fake profiles, harassment and scams lead to a ban.</p>
</div>
